            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Koozi_logo-blue_linen.jpg",
            "title": "Premium Upholstery Fabric Covers",
            "text": "<p>We thoughtfully select fabrics that combine timeless style, durability, and easy maintenance. Our linen covers are breathable and come in five natural earthy tones, seamlessly blending into any home decor. For a softer, cosier feel, our boucle fabric offers a rich, plush texture in a warm, buttery hue.</p>",
